      "created_at": "2013-03-17T19:01:50.000Z",
      "cooked": "<p>My partner came up with a question yesterday when we were talking about Iron Legacy - Pauline got killed so Paul is the last Legacy, hence he went a bit nuts about the whole thing, right? But could he not just have another kid (one day, you know, after he's a bit less grief-stricken from the death of this one) and pass on (ooh...\"pass on\" -&gt; \"Parsons\"? Just thought of that) the powers that way? I was thinking maybe he can't because it's only ever one child in the Legacy line has powers or something like that, and Pauline was the one so no-one else will get them even if Legacy has twenty kids or whatever.</p>",
      "post_number": 2,
      "post_type": 1,
      "updated_at": "2021-02-07T02:30:13.045Z",
